(PART A — INSTRUCTIONS TO BIDDERS) Tj T*
(1. The bid shall remain valid for 90 days from the date of opening of the technical bid.) Tj T*
(2. Conditional bids will be summarily rejected.) Tj T*
(3. The bidder shall submit the EMD in the form of online payment or bank guarantee from a) Tj T*
(scheduled bank.) Tj T*
(4. Bids received after the due date and time shall not be considered.) Tj T*
(5. The Department reserves the right to accept or reject any bid without assigning any reason.) Tj T*
(6. Bidders shall have completed at least one similar work of value not less than 40 % of the) Tj T*
(estimated cost during the last seven years.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(COMMERCIAL TERMS AND CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(1. The contractor shall indemnify the Department against all claims arising out of the work.) Tj T*
(2. Liquidated damages at 0.5 % per week of delay shall be levied, subject to a maximum of 10 %) Tj T*
(of the contract value.) Tj T*
(3. All disputes shall be subject to arbitration under the Arbitration and Conciliation Act,) Tj T*
(1996.) Tj T*
(4. Rates quoted shall be inclusive of all taxes, freight, insurance and transit risks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
