() Tj T*
(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers design, supply and commissioning of raw water pumping machinery) Tj T*
(complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — HORIZONTAL CENTRIFUGAL PUMPS) Tj T*
(1. Pumps shall conform to IS 1520:1980.) Tj T*
(2. Each pump shall deliver 250 m³/h against a total head of 45 m. The pump efficiency at the) Tj T*
(duty point shall not be less than 78%.) Tj T*
(3. Casing shall be of cast iron and impeller shall be of bronze.) Tj T*
(4. Noise level at 1 m from the pumpset shall not exceed 85 dB\(A\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PUMP DATA SHEET) Tj T*
(Discharge: 250 m³/h) Tj T*
(Total head: 45 m) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(1. Motors shall be squirrel cage induction motors conforming to IS 325:1996.) Tj T*
(2. The rated output of the motor shall be 37kW.) Tj T*
(3. Motors shall be suitable for 415V ± 15%, 50Hz ± 5%, 3 phase supply.) Tj T*
(4. Motors shall be energy efficient.) Tj T*
(5. Motors shall have class F insulation with temperature rise limited to class B and shall be) Tj T*
(suitable for S1 duty.) Tj T*
(6. Synchronous speed of the motor shall be 1500 RPM.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(1. Power cables shall be 11 kV grade, aluminium conductor, XLPE insulated, armoured and PVC) Tj T*
(sheathed, conforming to IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
